      "note": "One feed per tracked company (US and ASX symbols, e.g. NVDA, BHP.AX), so every company has its own news stream rather than only those a business section mentions. Aggregator: items mix Yahoo's own reporting with syndicated pieces (Motley Fool, Investing.com, Stocktwits), so it starts below a newspaper's reliability. Checked 2026-11-15: 19-20 recent items per symbol. Free for personal and research use; check Yahoo's terms before showing content to paying clients."
